cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite the accompanying manuscript."
title: "RoGS-Takeover: Lifecycle State Consistency for Cross-Session Map Takeover in Online 3DGS SLAM"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of a per-primitive lifecycle state consistency
  contract for online 3D Gaussian Splatting SLAM, and of the repair that lets a
  map saved by an earlier session be loaded into a running session as
  first-class primitives.
